00004186                           736  FILLOAD
00004186                           737  ; LOADS AN FILE FROM DISK TO MEMORY
00004186                           738  ; INPUT    : A0 - DESTINATION ADDR. WITH ENOUGH SPACE AVAILABLE.
00004186                           739  ;            A1 - POINTER TO FILE NAME
00004186                           740  ; OUTPUT   : NONE
00004186                           741  ; MODIFIES : NONE
00004186                           742  ; NOTE     : THE READ DATA LOOP READS 1 BYTE AT A TIME TO ENSURE ALL FILES CAN
00004186                           743  ;            BE LOADED. HOWEVER, IF THE FILE SIZE IS KNOWN BEFOREHAND, NO LOOP
00004186                           744  ;            WOULD BE NECESSARY AND A SINGLE CALL TO TRAP #15 TASK 53 WOULD READ
00004186                           745  ;            THE WHOLE FILE AS LONG AS THE FILE SIZE IS PLACED INTO D2.L.
00004186                           746  ; NOTE     : THE ZERO-TERMINATOR (JUST BEFORE CLOSE THE FILE) IS A REQUIREMENT
00004186                           747  ;            FOR TEXT-FILES IF THE TEXT IS TO BE PRINTED. FOR OTHER USES, IT
00004186                           748  ;            CAN BE REMOVED.
00004186                           749  ; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
00004186  48E7 E040                750              MOVEM.L D0-D2/A1,-(A7)          ; SAVE REGISTERS
