000051F4  4E75                    1275  DMMFFND     RTS
000051F6                          1276  
000051F6                          1277  ; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
000051F6                          1278  DMMNEXTO
000051F6                          1279  ; SEARCHES THE NEXT MEMORY SLOT WITH THE SPECIFIED ID AND OUTPUTS A POINTER
000051F6                          1280  ; TO THE CORRESPONDING DATA (SLOT ADDRESS+2)
000051F6                          1281  ; INPUT    - D0.W : ID TO SEARCH
000051F6                          1282  ;            A0   : POINTER WITHIN THE CURRENT SLOT
